== Notes ==

*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
* The in-game description lists "paralyze" as the descriptor, but the saves are made versus mind-affecting.
*Casting the spell [[Extend spell|extended]] doubles the duration of the cloud, but not the duration of the paralysis. [[Maximize spell|Maximize]] and [[Empower spell|empower]] affect the duration of the paralysis.

